The '''Witch's Bat''' is a [[Mob]] that is spawned in groups of 5 from {{MobSprite|Crazy Witch}}es during the [[Spooky Festival]].

== Spawning ==
'''Witch's Bats''' spawn in groups of 5 from {{MobSprite|Crazy Witch}}es as an attack during the [[Spooky Festival]].

== Behavior ==
'''Witch's Bats''' fly towards players and explode on impact.

